  "content": "<p>Telegram:<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fkapiteon_mods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://t.me/kapiteon_mods</a><br><br>也來看看我的其他模組：<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nonewfog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">NoNewFog</span>（NoGrayFog） <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">（NEW）</span></a><br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/direction-build\" rel=\"nofollow\">Direction Build </a></span></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/direction-build\" rel=\"nofollow\">（按住右鍵時協助單方向建造）</a><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastbuilder\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fast Builder </a></span></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastbuilder\" rel=\"nofollow\">（也含 FastDestroy）</a><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clearvision-nightvision-fullbrightness-fluidvision\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClearVision </a></span></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clearvision-nightvision-fullbrightness-fluidvision\" rel=\"nofollow\">（夜視 + 全亮度 + 流體視覺）</a><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><br></span></span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/keybinder\" rel=\"nofollow\">Command Binder </a></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/keybinder\" rel=\"nofollow\">（按鍵巨集）</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>FreeCam</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Freecam 模組是一個 Forge 修改，讓你能以<em>旁觀者</em>模式<em>飛行</em>穿越 Minecraft 世界。即使在<em>線上</em>伺服器中也能運作。Freecam 有助於探索地下世界或建造工廠。你可以任意穿越任何方塊。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在線上伺服器中，其他玩家和生物會看到你站在原地不動。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>按下 F6 可啟用/停用<em> FreeCam</em> 模式<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更好的使用方式是搭配亮度模組 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clearvision-nightvision-fullbrightness-fluidvision\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClearVision</a>（<strong>F7</strong> 可<strong>啟動 ClearVision</strong>）</span></p>",
